

Build All:
    # one-time configure — rerun only after CMakeLists.txt changes or a fresh clone
    cmake -S . -B build -G Ninja -DCMAKE_CXX_COMPILER=clang++

    # build all targets
    cmake --build build

    # run the test suite
    ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

Then: 
cmake --build build && ctest --test-dir build --output-on-failure

CMake Bypass for one file:
clang++ -std=c++20 -g -O0 -Wall -Wextra -Iinclude tests/test_types.cpp -o build/test_types && ./build/test_types

Syntax Check:
clang++ -std=c++20 -Iinclude -fsyntax-only tests/test_types.cpp

